   "idx": 3,
   "zh": "习近平指出，中美两国元首在不到半年时间里实现互访，在中美关系史上是前所未有的。我和特朗普总统一直通过各种方式保持沟通，共同为中美关系这艘大船领航掌舵。今年5月，我和特朗普总统一致决定构建中美建设性战略稳定关系。这一新定位反映了中美关系的现实，也体现了对未来的期许，是迈向两国正确相处之道的重要一步。我们要把这一愿景转化为行动，朝着合作为主、竞争有度、分歧可控、和平可期的方向努力，走出一条两个大国的正确相处之道。中美两国应当也完全可以在务实合作中互利共赢，在良性竞争中彼此成就，在求同存异中妥处分歧，在累积互信中构筑和平，让中美建设性战略稳定关系更好惠及两国人民和世界各国人民。",
   "en": "President Xi pointed out that the Chinese and U.S. presidents exchanging visits in less than half a year is unprecedented in the history of China-U.S. relations. He and President Trump had maintained communication through different means, and worked together to steer the giant ship of China-U.S. relations. President Xi said that this May, he and President Trump agreed to build a constructive China-U.S. relationship of strategic stability. This new vision reflects the realities of China-U.S. ties, embodies the expectations for the future, and is an important step toward a right approach for the two countries to get along with each other. The two sides should turn this vision into action, strive to take their relationship where cooperation is the mainstay, competition is kept within proper limits, differences are managed and peace can be expected, and chart the right path for the two major countries to get along. China and the United States should, and have all the conditions to, achieve mutual benefit and win-win results in practical cooperation, contribute to each other’s success through healthy competition, properly manage differences as they seek greater common ground, and build peace through greater mutual trust, so that the people of our two countries and of countries around the world can all benefit from a constructive China-U.S. relationship of strategic stability.",
   "kind": "para",
